  "message": "Sure thing. I’ve got a handful of specialist agents I can call on. There are four “mapper” agents—mapper_cash for cash purchases, mapper_card for card transactions, mapper_bank for ACH and online transfers, and mapper_other for checks and any uncategorized payments. Then we have the synthesizer that pulls all those mapper reports together, a receipt_scanner that hunts for stray or mis‑labelled receipt images, an expense_reconciler that finds expense rows without matching receipts, and a progress_check that tells us which reports already exist and how fresh they are. Let me know if you’d like any of them to run.",
